      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dost_pagasa/status/1973942893103755673",
      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 2 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Tropical Cyclone \"PAOLO\"\nIssued at: 11:00 AM, 03 October 2025(Friday)\n\nORANGE WARNING LEVEL: Zambales and Bataan.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING is THREATENING.\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Batangas, Cavite and Quezon(Tayabas, Atimonan, Pagbilao, Lucena, Tiaong, San Antonio, Dolores, Sariaya, Candelaria, Perez, Alabat, Quezon, Calauag, Lopez, Guinayangan, Tagkawayan, Buenavista, Mulanay, San Narciso, Catanauan, General Luna, Macalelon, Gumaca, Pitogo, Unisan, Plaridel, Agdangan, Padre Burgos, Polillo, Burdeos, Panukulan, Jomalig, Patnanungan, San Francisco, San Andres).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, light to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Tarlac, Metro Manila, Rizal, Pampanga, Nueva Ecija, Bulacan, Laguna and Quezon(General Nakar, Infanta, Lucban, Mauban, Real, Sampaloc) which may persist within 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 2:00 PM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
